{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take a look of the future <strong>YOU game</strong> in this <strong>demo</strong> !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a third person controller's game, play as a young man in combats, strategy and more !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Discover the Borderland's Castle and his owner !</u>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will experience 3 differents centuries from the Original Timelin of the game</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>1 : Broken Era</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>2 : Soldier Era</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>3 : Gold Era</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the Borderland's Castle, upgrade your skills, stats with experience and a level system, fight with enemies like soldier, skeletons or ancient mages. Save your progress and unlock 3 unique achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this demo, you can :</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >use skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >equip weapons, armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 diff\u00e9rents items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 ennemy type</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >quests, market, stats, skills...</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086900/c50f83adc666304ba94f0f6b6270f04b50a646c9.jpg"},{"name":"Die","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086900/f5518242c483be4d2e60d6584cec77690ca6d636.jpg"},{"name":"Finish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086900/ff09bbb8e7ad92089334498b1bb30c891b4a9a3c.jpg"},{"name":"Absolute Cinema","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/image