 progress and unlock 3 unique achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this demo, you can :</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >use skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >equip weapons, armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 diff\u00e9rents items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 ennemy type</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >quests, market, stats, skills...</p></li></ul>","developers":["Puchican"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3736750","name":"YOU"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086900/c285a2c13d651357688a86b169edb0ab3b718dec/header.jpg?t=1760184198","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4086900/638644440/267537c0936b36f5458c8b0a5af753848b75d236/1759615720/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759765888","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4086900/638644440/267537c0936b36f5458c8b0a5af753848b75d236/1759615720/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759765888","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4086900/638644440/267537c0936b36f5458c8b0a5af753848b75d236/1759615720/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759765888","id":257212302,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257212302/movie480.mp4?t=1759765888","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257212302/movie_max.mp4?t=1759765888"},"name":"Demo Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257212302/c325518bfbb52c819c499eebcbbcfe5962496f04/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759765888","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257212302/movie480.webm?t=1759765888","max":"htt